{"id": "dev000-ja", "item_id": "dev000", "arch": "supervisor", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["740"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第七百四十条（婚姻の届出の受理）は、婚姻の届出が関連する法令（第731条、732条、734条〜736条、前条第2項など）に違反しないことを認めた後でなければ受理できないと定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["740", "731", "732", "734", "736"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["731", "732", "734", "736"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 6, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 4430, "tokens_out": 448, "tokens": 4878, "latency_s": 29.66196668200064, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "supervisor", "in": 154, "out": 54, "ms": 3634.7007030017267}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 975, "out": 54, "ms": 4074.4848150006874}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1325, "out": 112, "ms": 6677.079324999795}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1551, "out": 75, "ms": 5186.041375000059}, {"node": "supervisor", "in": 226, "out": 85, "ms": 5761.673901999529}, {"node": "writer", "in": 199, "out": 68, "ms": 4316.052988000592}], "tools": [{"node": "researcher", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "婚姻の届出の受理", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "researcher", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "740"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev000-en", "item_id": "dev000", "arch": "supervisor", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["740"], "anchor": [], "answer": "Article 740 of the Civil Code (民法 第七百四十条) stipulates that a marriage registration is accepted if it does not violate the provisions of Articles 731, 732, 734–736, the second paragraph of the preceding article, and other laws.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["740", "731", "732", "734"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["731", "732", "734"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 5, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2914, "tokens_out": 347, "tokens": 3261, "latency_s": 24.00633574600033, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "supervisor", "in": 151, "out": 51, "ms": 4088.3249290000094}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 969, "out": 55, "ms": 3772.8231990004133}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1319, "out": 104, "ms": 6709.816446000332}, {"node": "supervisor", "in": 251, "out": 71, "ms": 5107.461135001358}, {"node": "writer", "in": 224, "out": 66, "ms": 4322.809036999388}], "tools": [{"node": "researcher", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "婚姻の届出の受理", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev001-ja", "item_id": "dev001", "arch": "supervisor", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["1003"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第 1002 条（民法）は、負担付遺贈の受遺者が遺贈の目的の価額を超えても負担義務を履行する責任を負わないことを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["1002"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["1002"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 5, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2881, "tokens_out": 261, "tokens": 3142, "latency_s": 18.416149000000587, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "supervisor", "in": 158, "out": 51, "ms": 4225.329009001143}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 976, "out": 58, "ms": 3904.520842999773}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1356, "out": 54, "ms": 3692.859488999602}, {"node": "supervisor", "in": 209, "out": 53, "ms": 2823.1352910006535}, {"node": "writer", "in": 182, "out": 45, "ms": 3764.4991140005004}], "tools": [{"node": "researcher", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "負担付遺贈の受遺者の免責", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev001-en", "item_id": "dev001", "arch": "supervisor", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["1003"], "anchor": [], "answer": "Article 1002 of the Civil Code (民法 第千二条) stipulates that a legatee receiving a legacy subject to a burden is liable only up to the value of the legacy and is exempt from liability if they waive the legacy.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["1002"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["1002"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 5, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2894, "tokens_out": 294, "tokens": 3188, "latency_s": 19.70417759599877, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "supervisor", "in": 155, "out": 57, "ms": 3418.077008000182}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 979, "out": 58, "ms": 4346.291963000112}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1359, "out": 63, "ms": 4920.2527920006105}, {"node": "supervisor", "in": 214, "out": 63, "ms": 3961.6593810005725}, {"node": "writer", "in": 187, "out": 53, "ms": 3052.745095999853}], "tools": [{"node": "researcher", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "負担付遺贈の受遺者の免責", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev002-ja", "item_id": "dev002", "arch": "supervisor", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["987"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第九百八十七条（民法）は、遺贈義務者や利害関係人が受遺者に相当期間を定めて遺贈の承認又は放棄を催告することを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["987"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 5, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2937, "tokens_out": 281, "tokens": 3218, "latency_s": 19.1029733510004, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "supervisor", "in": 160, "out": 68, "ms": 4239.351243999408}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 995, "out": 60, "ms": 4112.46609599948}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1379, "out": 58, "ms": 3764.1752060008002}, {"node": "supervisor", "in": 215, "out": 56, "ms": 4836.488595999981}, {"node": "writer", "in": 188, "out": 39, "ms": 2143.348898000113}], "tools": [{"node": "researcher", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受遺者に対する遺贈の承認又は放棄の催告", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev002-en", "item_id": "dev002", "arch": "supervisor", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["987"], "anchor": [], "answer": "Article 987 of the Civil Code (民法 第九百八十七条) stipulates that interested parties may demand from a legatee, within a reasonable period, whether they intend to accept or renounce a legacy.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["987"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 5, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2876, "tokens_out": 266, "tokens": 3142, "latency_s": 18.615022958998452, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "supervisor", "in": 157, "out": 45, "ms": 2882.6518559999386}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 969, "out": 61, "ms": 4501.996696000788}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1353, "out": 59, "ms": 4293.907668999964}, {"node": "supervisor", "in": 212, "out": 55, "ms": 3657.843925000634}, {"node": "writer", "in": 185, "out": 46, "ms": 3271.174252000492}], "tools": [{"node": "researcher", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受遺者に対する遺贈の承認又は放棄の催告", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev003-ja", "item_id": "dev003", "arch": "supervisor", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["395"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第 395 条（民法）は、抵当建物使用者が競売買受人に建物を引き渡す義務を、取得日から 6 ヶ月間猶予する旨を定めています。ただし、使用開始が取得後である場合や催告に応じない場合はこの猶予は適用されません。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["395"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 6, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 4604, "tokens_out": 422, "tokens": 5026, "latency_s": 27.36679454300065, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "supervisor", "in": 158, "out": 62, "ms": 3574.4270809991576}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 987, "out": 58, "ms": 4456.951681999271}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1332, "out": 40, "ms": 2688.38280700038}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1618, "out": 115, "ms": 6719.871409999541}, {"node": "supervisor", "in": 268, "out": 76, "ms": 5647.560125000382}, {"node": "writer", "in": 241, "out": 71, "ms": 4272.680523999952}], "tools": [{"node": "researcher", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "researcher", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "395"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev003-en", "item_id": "dev003", "arch": "supervisor", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["395"], "anchor": [], "answer": "Article 395 of the Civil Code, titled「抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予」, stipulates that a user of a mortgaged building under a lease not opposable to the mortgagee may be granted a six-month delay in delivering the building to the auction purchaser, unless the user commenced usage after the purchase or failed to pay for post-purchase use when demanded.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["395"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 6, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 4525, "tokens_out": 427, "tokens": 4952, "latency_s": 28.21655526199902, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "supervisor", "in": 155, "out": 49, "ms": 3271.7703329999495}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 971, "out": 59, "ms": 4656.947166999089}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1316, "out": 40, "ms": 3090.2737690012145}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1602, "out": 103, "ms": 6179.626907000056}, {"node": "supervisor", "in": 254, "out": 94, "ms": 5925.36571600067}, {"node": "writer", "in": 227, "out": 82, "ms": 5085.194765000779}], "tools": [{"node": "researcher", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "researcher", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "395"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev004-en", "item_id": "dev004", "arch": "supervisor", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["264-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "Civil Code Article 264-9 (第二百六十四条の九) provides that when a landowner's inadequate management infringes or threatens another's rights, the court may order a third party to manage the land.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["264-9"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 5, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2887, "tokens_out": 303, "tokens": 3190, "latency_s": 20.97793181199995, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "supervisor", "in": 150, "out": 54, "ms": 3744.0539189992705}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 971, "out": 53, "ms": 4054.3717489999835}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1335, "out": 83, "ms": 4763.242423001429}, {"node": "supervisor", "in": 229, "out": 67, "ms": 4747.69430500055}, {"node": "writer", "in": 202, "out": 46, "ms": 3663.517255001352}], "tools": [{"node": "researcher", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "管理不全土地管理命令", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev004-ja", "item_id": "dev004", "arch": "supervisor", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["264-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法には「管理不全土地管理命令」を直接定める条文はなく、関連規定は第 264 条の 9 から第 264 条の 13 までです。第 264 条の 9 は所有者の不適切な管理を是正するため裁判所が管理人を選任して管理を命じる命令を定めています。第 264 条の 10 から 13 は当該管理人の権限、義務、解任・辞任、報酬等について定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["264-9", "264-13", "264-10"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["264-13", "264-10"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 10, "tool_calls": 7, "tokens_in": 9080, "tokens_out": 822, "tokens": 9902, "latency_s": 53.14907685700018, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "supervisor", "in": 153, "out": 52, "ms": 2876.7288250001}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 972, "out": 53, "ms": 4253.5919600013585}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1336, "out": 67, "ms": 4018.894299000749}, {"node": "supervisor", "in": 217, "out": 56, "ms": 3586.903893999988}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1041, "out": 214, "ms": 13153.334063001239}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 2101, "out": 103, "ms": 6932.95200799912}, {"node": "supervisor", "in": 322, "out": 53, "ms": 3591.9375120010955}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1143, "out": 42, "ms": 3305.951557998924}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1434, "out": 64, "ms": 4467.04733399929}, {"node": "writer", "in": 361, "out": 118, "ms": 6949.259365999751}], "tools": [{"node": "researcher", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "管理不全土地管理命令", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "researcher", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "264-9"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "researcher", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "264-10"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "researcher", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "264-11"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "researcher", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "264-12"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "researcher", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "264-13"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "researcher", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "264-9"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev005-ja", "item_id": "dev005", "arch": "supervisor", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["413"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第 478 条（受領遅滞）は、債権者以外の者が弁済を受領する権限を持たない場合、債務者が弁済しても債権は消滅しないことを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["478"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["478"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 5, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2851, "tokens_out": 267, "tokens": 3118, "latency_s": 14.915547669001171, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "supervisor", "in": 152, "out": 48, "ms": 2887.0179780005856}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 967, "out": 52, "ms": 3016.2551249995886}, {"node": "researcher.agent", "in": 1333, "out": 64, "ms": 3101.41347300123}, {"node": "supervisor", "in": 213, "out": 55, "ms": 3237.7294570014783}, {"node": "writer", "in": 186, "out": 48, "ms": 2668.287758000588}], "tools": [{"node": "researcher", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受領遅滞", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
